.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Each line of a diffraction pattern is a family of (hkl) planes that satisfies Bragg&#x27;s law n\lambda=2d\sin\theta. powder_xrd_peaks computes each reflection&#x27;s structure factor (~chemistrykit.crystal.systems.xrd.structure_factor) directly from atomic positions and Miller indices, so BCC&#x27;s and FCC&#x27;s systematic absences (reflections with zero intensity by symmetry) fall out automatically rather than being hardcoded as a rule.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/crystal/xrd/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_powder_xrd_thumb.png
    :alt:

  :doc:`/api/gallery/crystal/xrd/plot_01_powder_xrd`

